# Stage 4: the saved book read back, widths, paging, quitting with changes.
SNAP                                        # 1 sheet 1 after the edits
> > > SNAP                                  # 2 column A widened by 3
< < < < < < < < < < < < < SNAP              # 3 down to the minimum
PGDN SNAP                                   # 4 next page
END SNAP                                    # 5 last used cell
HOME TAB SNAP                               # 6 sheet 2
RET C-u "changed" RET ESC SNAP              # 7 unsaved change: asks
n SNAP                                      # 8 stays
ESC y SNAP                                  # 9 discarded and closed
